WEBVTT

﻿1

00:02:33.584 --> 00:02:36.834
When Bruce Lee died, he was only 32.


00:02:37.417 --> 00:02:39.792
His sudden death shocked the world.


00:02:40.542 --> 00:02:42.001
To his fans,


00:02:42.167 --> 00:02:44.376
he was a unique superstar.


00:02:45.084 --> 00:02:46.209
But to our family,


00:02:46.376 --> 00:02:47.917
he was our brother.


00:02:48.167 --> 00:02:52.959
We grew up and spent our childhood together.


00:02:53.292 --> 00:02:56.709
Looking at this house reminds me of


00:02:56.876 --> 00:02:59.834
my brother Phoenix, my family


00:03:00.001 --> 00:03:03.292
and how we grew up together.


00:03:03.626 --> 00:03:05.626
I'm overwhelmed with emotions.


00:03:06.167 --> 00:03:09.251
This movie is about Bruce Lee's untold story,


00:03:09.417 --> 00:03:12.209
which is also our family story.


00:03:47.459 --> 00:03:50.292
Why did you set me up?


00:03:50.626 --> 00:03:53.251
I'm just a poor farmer,


00:03:53.417 --> 00:03:58.417
I can't read poetry.


00:04:15.334 --> 00:04:16.584
Chuen, I just got a call.


00:04:16.751 --> 00:04:18.376
Your wife is going into labor.


00:04:19.376 --> 00:04:20.834
Quick.


00:04:21.084 --> 00:04:22.417
Get the car.


00:04:31.709 --> 00:04:33.292
My Father Lee Hoi-chuen was


00:04:33.459 --> 00:04:35.626
a leading comic in Cantonese Opera.


00:04:36.292 --> 00:04:39.376
That year, he took Mother with him
on a tour in San Francisco.


00:04:39.542 --> 00:04:42.084
They were greeted with a surprise.


00:04:43.167 --> 00:04:46.376
It actually snowed in San Francisco.


00:04:46.834 --> 00:04:50.542
Push...


00:04:51.001 --> 00:04:53.626
You can do it, push...


00:04:53.792 --> 00:04:55.917
I can see your son.


00:05:03.834 --> 00:05:05.917
Chuen, here they come.


00:05:09.751 --> 00:05:11.251
Grace,


00:05:11.917 --> 00:05:13.084
are you tired?


00:05:13.709 --> 00:05:14.459
I'm fine.


00:05:14.626 --> 00:05:15.667
Boy or girl?


00:05:16.334 --> 00:05:18.792
Boy...


00:05:18.959 --> 00:05:20.751
A son.


00:05:21.251 --> 00:05:22.626
Thank Heavens.


00:05:22.792 --> 00:05:24.459
Excuse me.


00:05:24.667 --> 00:05:25.792
- Are you alright?
- Chuen...


00:05:25.959 --> 00:05:27.626
- Excuse me, sir.
- She's talking to you.


00:05:27.792 --> 00:05:30.126
We need the boy's name for registration.


00:05:31.126 --> 00:05:33.417
Name?


00:05:33.751 --> 00:05:38.834
Push... Push...


00:05:39.042 --> 00:05:40.834
Push...


00:05:41.251 --> 00:05:43.376
P... Push... Push...


00:05:43.542 --> 00:05:44.459
Bruce?


00:05:44.626 --> 00:05:46.917
Push... Lee...


00:05:47.459 --> 00:05:50.459
- Bruce Lee?
- Yes...


00:05:51.376 --> 00:05:51.959
Is that it?


00:05:52.126 --> 00:05:54.084
Push...


00:05:55.292 --> 00:05:56.792
Push Lee.


00:06:18.626 --> 00:06:21.209
Camera... action.


00:06:23.417 --> 00:06:25.834
I'm sure the three of us


00:06:26.001 --> 00:06:28.376
will be happy here.


00:06:32.376 --> 00:06:33.417
Cut.


00:06:33.584 --> 00:06:34.667
Is that OK?


00:06:34.834 --> 00:06:36.001
Good take.


00:06:36.209 --> 00:06:38.834
Is he done?


00:06:39.001 --> 00:06:39.792
Yes.


00:06:39.959 --> 00:06:41.667
Thanks for letting us use him.


00:06:41.834 --> 00:06:43.167
This is for him.


00:06:43.334 --> 00:06:44.542
You shouldn't have.


00:06:44.709 --> 00:06:46.792
Chinese on the road


00:06:46.959 --> 00:06:48.834
should help each other out.


00:06:49.001 --> 00:06:50.334
You're going back to Hong Kong?


00:06:50.501 --> 00:06:52.376
Yes, I'm trying to get tickets.


00:06:52.542 --> 00:06:55.084
It's not safe back home. You should stay.


00:06:55.251 --> 00:06:58.001
I can't. I have a big family to support.


00:06:58.167 --> 00:06:59.667
I have to go back.


00:06:59.834 --> 00:07:02.626
Mother sent a telegram yesterday.


00:07:02.792 --> 00:07:04.042
She wanted us to stay for now.


00:07:04.251 --> 00:07:06.459
She doesn't mean it.


00:07:06.626 --> 00:07:09.626
She couldn't wait to meet her grandson.
We must go.


00:07:25.376 --> 00:07:27.126
Welcome home, Master Chuen.


00:07:30.709 --> 00:07:32.709
Lee Jun-fan, you're home.


00:07:39.459 --> 00:07:40.876
You're home.


00:07:41.042 --> 00:07:42.251
- Where's Mother?
- Upstairs...


00:07:42.376 --> 00:07:44.251
- Watch out.
- Let me see him.


00:07:45.292 --> 00:07:47.751
- Mother...
- Mother is upstairs.


00:07:48.417 --> 00:07:50.084
Mother.


00:07:51.042 --> 00:07:52.584
Master Chuen is back.


00:07:52.792 --> 00:07:54.126
Mother.


00:07:57.917 --> 00:07:59.292
Chuen?


00:08:00.084 --> 00:08:01.376
Mother.


00:08:03.876 --> 00:08:05.084
Father.


00:08:05.251 --> 00:08:09.459
Phoebe, Agnes, Peter.


00:08:10.042 --> 00:08:10.876
- Mother.
- Mother.


00:08:11.042 --> 00:08:11.792
You're home.


00:08:11.959 --> 00:08:13.417
Yes.


00:08:13.626 --> 00:08:16.626
Kowtow to your ancestors, not to me.


00:08:17.751 --> 00:08:18.626
Mother.


00:08:18.792 --> 00:08:20.584
My grandson.


00:08:21.584 --> 00:08:22.917
So cute.


00:08:23.251 --> 00:08:24.626
Look at Him.


00:08:27.334 --> 00:08:28.542
Have you named him yet?


00:08:28.792 --> 00:08:30.126
I want to call him...


00:08:30.292 --> 00:08:33.209
Phoenix... give him a girl's name,


00:08:33.376 --> 00:08:35.834
to fool the demons so he'll grow up well.


00:08:36.001 --> 00:08:37.126
Phoenix...


00:08:50.959 --> 00:08:52.626
Get me two eggs.


00:08:53.584 --> 00:08:54.334
Pass me the ginger.


00:08:54.501 --> 00:08:56.126
The soup is ready, turn down the stove.


00:08:57.334 --> 00:08:59.084
The fish looks very delicious.


00:08:59.667 --> 00:09:00.959
Hurry.


00:09:01.709 --> 00:09:03.959
Clean up the kitchen.


00:09:05.167 --> 00:09:09.001
Let's eat.


00:09:09.501 --> 00:09:10.792
Let's eat.


00:09:11.751 --> 00:09:13.709
Stop playing, Skinny.


00:09:14.167 --> 00:09:15.834
Come here and eat.


00:09:18.292 --> 00:09:19.376
Dinner is ready.


00:09:19.542 --> 00:09:22.126
- Let's eat.
- Let's eat.


00:09:23.542 --> 00:09:26.834
Let's eat... Phoenix. Let's eat.


00:09:27.001 --> 00:09:29.834
Good boy.


00:09:31.542 --> 00:09:32.917
Let's eat.


00:09:39.459 --> 00:09:39.792
Sorry.


00:09:39.959 --> 00:09:47.667
Let's eat.


00:09:47.876 --> 00:09:49.417
Let's eat, Mother.


00:09:49.834 --> 00:09:52.626
Let's eat.


00:09:55.126 --> 00:09:58.251
The food in San Francisco is not for man.


00:09:58.417 --> 00:10:00.251
It's for those devils.


00:10:01.042 --> 00:10:02.417
It's for those foreign devils.


00:10:02.584 --> 00:10:03.876
Those steaks and potatoes...


00:10:04.042 --> 00:10:05.251
There's no place like home, I like rice...


00:10:05.417 --> 00:10:08.876
Chuen, don't talk with your mouth full.


00:10:09.667 --> 00:10:11.667
- Right, Mother.
- Good boy...


00:10:11.834 --> 00:10:12.792
You know why I


00:10:12.959 --> 00:10:14.917
named him Phoenix?


00:10:15.084 --> 00:10:16.084
Why?


00:10:16.376 --> 00:10:17.584
He's born in wartime.


00:10:17.751 --> 00:10:22.459
I want him to rise like a phoenix in a fire.


00:10:22.709 --> 00:10:25.251
Back in San Francisco, I already...


00:10:25.417 --> 00:10:30.459
I told you not to talk with your mouth full.


00:10:33.459 --> 00:10:34.751
Right, Mother.


00:10:50.584 --> 00:10:53.417
Kiddo, this house is full of women,


00:10:53.584 --> 00:10:55.501
and with a girl's name like Phoenix,


00:10:55.667 --> 00:10:58.042
you might grow up to be a sissy.


00:10:58.209 --> 00:11:02.209
Let me help you be a man.


00:11:04.876 --> 00:11:08.292
Does he look like me?


00:11:09.584 --> 00:11:13.042
Oh my goodness. Leave him alone.


00:11:13.626 --> 00:11:17.042
Ngan, please take Phoenix.


00:11:18.167 --> 00:11:18.959
- Phoenix.
- Look at you.


00:11:19.126 --> 00:11:21.251
What has he done to you?


00:11:21.417 --> 00:11:23.667
I'll put you to bed, all right?


00:11:23.834 --> 00:11:25.292
Clean him up.


00:11:25.667 --> 00:11:27.042
Don't worry.


00:11:27.334 --> 00:11:29.626
Go. Phoenix has gone to bed.


00:11:43.292 --> 00:11:45.126
When I met you,


00:11:46.376 --> 00:11:48.876
your hands were soft


00:11:49.584 --> 00:11:53.292
and smooth.


00:11:53.834 --> 00:11:57.167
Now they're coarse and yellow...


00:11:59.001 --> 00:12:01.376
Thanks to your pipe.


00:12:02.917 --> 00:12:04.709
Who knows


00:12:04.876 --> 00:12:08.334
when the Japs will be here?


00:12:09.542 --> 00:12:12.751
Let's hope the Brits can hold them off.


00:12:20.042 --> 00:12:23.292
Actually, what's important is


00:12:24.042 --> 00:12:26.751
for our family to be in a piece


00:12:27.167 --> 00:12:28.917
and to be together.


00:12:45.251 --> 00:12:47.042
Go to sleep, Phoenix.


00:13:17.584 --> 00:13:21.334
Our house was always bustling.


00:13:21.501 --> 00:13:23.751
Father worked hard to support us


00:13:23.917 --> 00:13:26.209
while Mother looked after everyone.


00:13:26.376 --> 00:13:30.042
The days went by quickly.


00:13:47.292 --> 00:13:49.084
Don't bother with make-up,


00:13:49.251 --> 00:13:51.209
the show will probably be canceled.


00:13:51.667 --> 00:13:52.417
Why?


00:13:52.626 --> 00:13:54.334
The Japs dropped a bomb in Shatin.


00:13:54.501 --> 00:13:56.751
They'll be crossing the Lo Wu Bridge soon.


00:13:58.959 --> 00:14:00.459
Forget the show.


00:14:00.626 --> 00:14:02.667
Let's go home.


00:14:35.709 --> 00:14:38.126
You're so lucky, Mother.


00:14:38.292 --> 00:14:40.209
The Japs are at our front door


00:14:40.376 --> 00:14:43.334
but you don't have to worry anymore.


00:14:49.376 --> 00:14:53.792
The family is still together.


00:14:53.959 --> 00:14:56.501
Phoenix is coming to his senses.


00:14:56.709 --> 00:14:58.501
Don't worry.


00:15:03.292 --> 00:15:04.376
Open up.


00:15:04.542 --> 00:15:05.917
Brother Chuen?


00:15:06.251 --> 00:15:07.501
Open the door.


00:15:07.667 --> 00:15:09.084
Open up.


00:15:11.501 --> 00:15:13.334
So this is the Lee residence.


00:15:16.792 --> 00:15:19.001
Go inside... hurry.


00:15:19.292 --> 00:15:21.334
Go with Auntie Ngan.


00:15:21.542 --> 00:15:23.084
Go inside... hurry.


00:15:28.292 --> 00:15:33.751
General Wakuda wants to
meet the famous actor Lee Hoi-chuen.


00:15:34.334 --> 00:15:37.042
I want your whole family to come out.


00:15:53.834 --> 00:15:55.209
Yes.


00:16:01.376 --> 00:16:03.709
Wakuda-san wants to


00:16:03.876 --> 00:16:07.834
use Mr Lee's popularity


00:16:08.001 --> 00:16:13.042
to incite your fellow actors to
serve the Japanese Imperial Army.


00:16:14.709 --> 00:16:15.917
I'm flattered


00:16:16.084 --> 00:16:19.792
but I'm only an actor trying to support a family.


00:16:19.959 --> 00:16:24.042
I'm afraid I can't manage.


00:16:26.584 --> 00:16:31.334
Don't be stupid, Mr Lee.


00:16:32.084 --> 00:16:35.251
Actors like me can only entertain the people.


00:16:35.417 --> 00:16:40.126
I can't help you


00:16:40.292 --> 00:16:43.876
keep a facade of peace and stability.


00:16:44.959 --> 00:16:47.751
That's what the Greater East Asia
Co-Prosperity Sphere is about.


00:16:47.917 --> 00:16:53.584
Me and the Imperial Army are serving the people.


00:16:53.751 --> 00:16:56.334
My brother said no. Get lost.


00:16:56.709 --> 00:16:58.042
Go away.


00:17:03.834 --> 00:17:05.167
If he won't,


00:17:05.334 --> 00:17:07.959
perhaps you can dance for the troops.


00:17:08.126 --> 00:17:10.126
Let go of me, asshole.


00:17:10.292 --> 00:17:11.959
Bitch.


00:17:13.834 --> 00:17:14.751
- Traitor.
- Idiot.


00:17:14.917 --> 00:17:17.251
I'm sorry, Mr Wakuda.


00:17:17.417 --> 00:17:19.292
I'm so sorry, Mr Wakuda.


00:17:19.459 --> 00:17:21.709
Please forgive her naivete.


00:17:21.876 --> 00:17:24.001
Please forgive her... I'm so sorry.


00:17:24.167 --> 00:17:26.084
Can't you walk properly?


00:17:28.626 --> 00:17:31.417
Apologize if you don't want to die. Say it.


00:17:32.001 --> 00:17:33.792
I'm sorry...


00:17:33.959 --> 00:17:34.709
Sorry.


00:17:34.876 --> 00:17:36.751
Louder.


00:17:37.626 --> 00:17:39.667
- I'm so sorry.
- I'm so sorry.


00:17:39.876 --> 00:17:41.501
Bruce.


00:17:43.584 --> 00:17:45.001
I'm sorry.


00:17:45.959 --> 00:17:48.959
I'm sorry...


00:17:49.251 --> 00:17:51.542
I'm sorry...


00:17:51.709 --> 00:17:53.334
I'll handle this.


00:17:53.501 --> 00:17:55.542
I'm sorry.


00:17:56.917 --> 00:18:04.792
I'm sorry.


00:18:05.334 --> 00:18:11.751
About the show... wise up


00:18:12.792 --> 00:18:14.917
and do the right thing.


00:18:20.251 --> 00:18:21.917
My name is Ngai.


00:18:23.667 --> 00:18:25.667
Goodbye.


00:18:36.751 --> 00:18:39.376
Sorry...


00:19:21.042 --> 00:19:23.417
After the endless 3 years and 8 months,


00:19:23.584 --> 00:19:26.584
Japan was defeated and Hong Kong was liberated.


00:19:28.167 --> 00:19:32.376
Prosperity was restored and
life went back to normal.


00:19:35.001 --> 00:19:39.626
Father continued to act while the kids grew up.


00:19:40.001 --> 00:19:43.126
Everything was fine again in the Lee Family.


00:19:55.084 --> 00:19:56.584
The baby kicked me again.


00:19:57.501 --> 00:19:58.751
I won.


00:19:58.917 --> 00:20:01.792
You're so lucky. I'm sure you'll win today.


00:20:06.626 --> 00:20:09.667
It's Margaret's turn. She's our guest.


00:20:10.709 --> 00:20:12.501
Thanks,Phoebe.


00:20:13.209 --> 00:20:15.251
- Is the been ready yet?
- Get me two eggs.


00:20:15.417 --> 00:20:16.751
OK. OK.


00:20:17.334 --> 00:20:19.501
Where's the sausage?


00:20:21.126 --> 00:20:23.251
I'll kill you Japs.


00:20:26.501 --> 00:20:27.709
Here comes the anti-Japanese fighter.


00:20:27.876 --> 00:20:30.834
Stop it, Phoenix. Stop it.


00:20:33.167 --> 00:20:35.542
- Are you alright?
- I'm fine.


00:20:35.709 --> 00:20:39.167
I'll kill you Jap for bullying Margaret.


00:20:51.292 --> 00:20:55.542
Father was enjoying a rare day off
when a guest dropped by.


00:20:55.876 --> 00:20:57.209
His name was Leung Sing-po.


00:20:57.751 --> 00:21:00.542
Don't be mad, I'll buy you dinner.


00:21:00.709 --> 00:21:03.417
- What a crowd.
- I'm lucky today.


00:21:03.709 --> 00:21:05.626
I'll get out of your way.


00:21:07.417 --> 00:21:09.042
- Honey.
- Daddy.


00:21:09.209 --> 00:21:11.459
Be a good girl, Honey.


00:21:12.001 --> 00:21:13.292
Sir.


00:21:14.667 --> 00:21:16.376
Sir.


00:21:17.709 --> 00:21:19.417
Po.


00:21:19.584 --> 00:21:21.167
I came to pick up my brat.


00:21:21.334 --> 00:21:23.959
What's your hurry? Sit down


00:21:24.376 --> 00:21:26.167
and have a smoke.


00:21:26.334 --> 00:21:28.542
No thanks, I smoke cigars in Singapore.


00:21:28.709 --> 00:21:30.584
Help yourself.


00:21:31.334 --> 00:21:32.834
What have you been up to lately?


00:21:33.001 --> 00:21:35.501
I just finished a run


00:21:35.667 --> 00:21:37.459
with "Fa Kam Sau" in Guangzhou.


00:21:37.626 --> 00:21:41.251
I'll stay in Hong Kong after the New Year.


00:21:41.417 --> 00:21:42.417
Good. You should come back.


00:21:42.584 --> 00:21:45.751
When would you get me into films?


00:21:45.917 --> 00:21:47.209
That will be swell.


00:21:47.376 --> 00:21:48.751
I'll speak to the directors.


00:21:48.917 --> 00:21:51.126
- I'm counting on you.
- You're welcome.


00:21:53.126 --> 00:21:54.001
What?


00:21:54.167 --> 00:21:55.251
I won.


00:21:55.417 --> 00:21:57.584
- Pay up.
- Look.


00:21:57.751 --> 00:22:00.167
You're a tile short. This one doesn't count.


00:22:00.334 --> 00:22:02.917
What's the racket? Did someone win?


00:22:04.667 --> 00:22:06.126
Get off it.


00:22:06.251 --> 00:22:07.251
I think my baby is coming out.


00:22:07.417 --> 00:22:08.459
You can't be...


00:22:08.626 --> 00:22:10.251
Chuen. Your wife is having the baby.


00:22:12.959 --> 00:22:14.542
Help her to her room.


00:22:18.167 --> 00:22:19.876
Over here.


00:22:20.251 --> 00:22:25.751
Ready. 1, 2, 3, smile.


00:22:40.292 --> 00:22:41.292
Aim carefully.


00:22:41.459 --> 00:22:42.792
How could I miss?


00:22:42.959 --> 00:22:45.292
Gosh, way too bad.


00:22:48.459 --> 00:22:49.959
You lost again.


00:22:53.209 --> 00:22:56.167
- Damn.
- it's a piece of cake.


00:22:57.792 --> 00:23:00.209
- Great. We won.
- Brilliant.


00:23:05.334 --> 00:23:05.792
Run.


00:23:05.959 --> 00:23:07.001
He stole our marbles.


00:23:07.167 --> 00:23:10.334
Stop there, you son of a bitch. Go after him.


00:23:11.209 --> 00:23:13.584
Run faster.


00:23:13.834 --> 00:23:15.001
How dare you took from me.


00:23:15.209 --> 00:23:17.834
- Come back.
- Over there.


00:23:19.001 --> 00:23:21.042
Kiddo, what's wrong with you?


00:23:27.001 --> 00:23:29.209
- You bastard.
- Bastard.


00:23:29.334 --> 00:23:31.001
Serve you right for taking my marbles.


00:23:32.334 --> 00:23:34.542
How dare you try to rip me off.


00:23:34.709 --> 00:23:35.709
Stop it.


00:23:35.876 --> 00:23:37.792
I will return them to you.


00:23:39.209 --> 00:23:40.959
You'll be my Chief, alright?


00:23:41.167 --> 00:23:42.042
What's your name?


00:23:42.251 --> 00:23:43.501
Unicorn.


00:23:43.667 --> 00:23:45.501
- Do you know who I am?
- Yes


00:23:45.667 --> 00:23:49.376
You're Lee Hoi-chuen's son, Phoenix.


00:23:49.876 --> 00:23:50.792
You know me?


00:23:50.959 --> 00:23:54.376
My father Choi Fei-I am is a stuntman.


00:23:54.542 --> 00:23:56.001
I've seen you before.


00:23:56.167 --> 00:23:57.626
Then I'll let you go.


00:23:57.792 --> 00:23:59.876
- He's the Chief now.
- Yes.


00:24:00.042 --> 00:24:01.334
Chief.


00:24:01.501 --> 00:24:02.709
Thanks. Chief.


00:24:03.376 --> 00:24:04.334
Why did you kick me?


00:24:04.501 --> 00:24:06.626
Your old man is a stuntman.
You should fight better.


00:24:06.792 --> 00:24:07.709
Come fight with me.


00:24:07.876 --> 00:24:10.876
Give him a hand, Skinny.


00:24:11.042 --> 00:24:13.167
Tell your friends to jump in.


00:24:13.334 --> 00:24:14.751
You're such a sloppy cat.


00:24:38.542 --> 00:24:40.209
- Great.
- Brilliant.


00:24:40.376 --> 00:24:42.334
You know what's in the box?


00:24:43.334 --> 00:24:44.792
Mail?


00:24:44.959 --> 00:24:49.917
Wrong. They hang rat bins on lamp posts.


00:24:50.084 --> 00:24:52.584
Hanging rat bins on lamp posts.


00:24:52.792 --> 00:24:54.251
Here's another one.


00:24:57.834 --> 00:25:01.334
A rat. Grab it, don't let it get away.


00:25:09.459 --> 00:25:10.834
You go first.


00:25:20.709 --> 00:25:22.417
Damn you, Skinny.


00:25:22.584 --> 00:25:23.876
You stink.


00:25:57.126 --> 00:25:58.709
OK.


00:26:02.417 --> 00:26:03.751
Don't get smug.


00:26:03.917 --> 00:26:05.709
I can smell you from a mile away.


00:26:05.876 --> 00:26:07.167
This is so unfair.


00:26:07.334 --> 00:26:08.959
Get down on your knees.


00:26:11.376 --> 00:26:13.542
Tell me what you have done.


00:26:13.709 --> 00:26:16.084
I picked a fight, played hooky
and climbed up the pipes.


00:26:16.251 --> 00:26:17.751
What else?


00:26:17.917 --> 00:26:19.709
- What have you done?
- Ouch.


00:26:19.876 --> 00:26:21.959
How many times did I tell you?


00:26:22.126 --> 00:26:25.209
How can I face Master Chuen? Why won't you listen?


00:26:25.376 --> 00:26:28.501
- Skinny's Mom.
- When will you ever learn?


00:26:30.709 --> 00:26:31.959
Don't hit him.


00:26:32.126 --> 00:26:35.709
It's my fault. I failed to discipline him.


00:26:37.876 --> 00:26:40.626
Go inside.


00:26:40.792 --> 00:26:44.376
You should look after Master Phoenix,


00:26:45.709 --> 00:26:47.542
What are you doing? Give me that.


00:26:47.709 --> 00:26:50.292
She's telling me I can't discipline my son.


00:26:50.459 --> 00:26:51.709
He's too little to get a beating.


00:26:51.876 --> 00:26:54.584
I must discipline him while he's little. Go away.


00:26:54.751 --> 00:26:56.542
Sit down.


00:27:00.542 --> 00:27:03.251
What have you done? The cops were here.


00:27:03.417 --> 00:27:04.626
I did nothing illegal.


00:27:07.751 --> 00:27:09.042
No? You broke every rat bin


00:27:09.209 --> 00:27:10.126
on the street.


00:27:10.292 --> 00:27:12.126
You're getting out of hand.


00:27:14.584 --> 00:27:17.084
Why are you crying? I haven't even started.


00:27:17.376 --> 00:27:19.126
Peter.


00:27:19.459 --> 00:27:22.751
You should watch your little brother.


00:27:25.917 --> 00:27:27.917
Stop crying. Phoebe.


00:27:28.084 --> 00:27:30.876
I know you tipped him off.


00:27:31.042 --> 00:27:34.001
And you, Agnes, you knew but didn't tell me.


00:27:34.167 --> 00:27:36.709
You all covered up for him.


00:27:38.834 --> 00:27:41.376
Kowtow to your ancestors. 200 times each.


00:27:56.917 --> 00:27:58.251
Welcome, Mr Fung.


00:28:01.751 --> 00:28:03.334
What's going on?


00:28:06.001 --> 00:28:08.501
What brings you here?


00:28:08.667 --> 00:28:11.667
I want to talk to you about Phoenix.


00:28:11.834 --> 00:28:13.501
Phoenix?


00:28:13.709 --> 00:28:17.251
Yuen Po-wan wrote an excellent script.
I'm directing it.


00:28:17.417 --> 00:28:20.792
I want Phoenix for the lead.


00:28:22.917 --> 00:28:25.876
Him? In a film? No.


00:28:26.042 --> 00:28:29.417
He has the talent. He takes after you.


00:28:29.584 --> 00:28:32.501
The role is tailor-made for him.


00:28:32.626 --> 00:28:35.792
It's a good opportunity. Think about it.


00:28:36.167 --> 00:28:39.542
Have some tea.


00:28:43.542 --> 00:28:45.001
Chuen.


00:28:45.834 --> 00:28:48.459
Mr Fung has a good point.


00:28:48.626 --> 00:28:52.167
He even gave him a name:


00:28:53.209 --> 00:28:55.751
Lee Siu-lung, the Little Dragon.


00:28:56.584 --> 00:28:58.667
Little Dragon?


00:28:59.292 --> 00:29:03.626
It suits him.


00:29:04.417 --> 00:29:06.334
He's born in the year of the Dragon.


00:29:15.001 --> 00:29:18.667
I'll think about it.


00:29:21.876 --> 00:29:24.334
Little Dragon.


00:29:25.792 --> 00:29:31.792
Cool. I can skip school and act.


00:29:33.584 --> 00:29:35.251
Cool.


00:29:35.417 --> 00:29:39.042
Follow him from the door.


00:29:39.209 --> 00:29:40.917
Bruce Lee, stand by.


00:29:41.209 --> 00:29:42.792
Right here.


00:29:43.876 --> 00:29:45.626
Yes, stop right here.


00:29:45.834 --> 00:29:47.376
Phoenix,


00:29:47.584 --> 00:29:49.376
I mean Dragon.


00:29:49.584 --> 00:29:51.792
This is what I want you to do...


00:29:51.959 --> 00:29:53.417
I'll hide in here


00:29:53.584 --> 00:29:55.501
and you'll let me out.


00:29:55.667 --> 00:29:57.209
Still remember my name in the film?


00:29:57.417 --> 00:30:00.251
You're Flying Dagger Lee.


00:30:00.417 --> 00:30:02.084
Brilliant.


00:30:02.417 --> 00:30:04.251
Action.


00:30:15.001 --> 00:30:15.834
Where are the cops?


00:30:16.001 --> 00:30:18.417
They're gone, you better split.


00:30:19.584 --> 00:30:22.042
Want some money, kid?


00:30:22.209 --> 00:30:25.251
No. Let me double check.


00:30:33.417 --> 00:30:33.959
They're gone?


00:30:34.126 --> 00:30:35.042
Gone.


00:30:35.209 --> 00:30:36.417
Listen up, kid.


00:30:36.626 --> 00:30:39.001
If someone bullies you from now on,


00:30:39.209 --> 00:30:41.834
look for me at No. 4, Tai Yuan Lane.


00:30:42.001 --> 00:30:44.126
Just ask for Flying Dagger Lee.


00:30:44.292 --> 00:30:46.542
Flying Dagger Lee, right?


00:30:46.709 --> 00:30:47.751
You better go.


00:30:47.917 --> 00:30:49.417
Right.


00:30:52.042 --> 00:30:53.292
Close the door.


00:30:56.334 --> 00:30:58.501
Cut. How was it?


00:30:58.709 --> 00:30:59.667
No problem.


00:30:59.792 --> 00:31:01.251
You did good.


00:31:01.417 --> 00:31:02.459
You bet.


00:31:02.626 --> 00:31:03.376
Next.


00:31:03.542 --> 00:31:05.751
Since then, not only Phoebe,


00:31:05.917 --> 00:31:09.126
but our whole family became Bruce's fans.


00:31:09.292 --> 00:31:11.459
He made a dozen more films


00:31:11.626 --> 00:31:14.667
and became a big star.


00:31:44.001 --> 00:31:46.584
Peter, you'll represent


00:31:46.751 --> 00:31:51.042
La Salle at the Inter-school Fencing Tournament.


00:31:51.209 --> 00:31:54.292
I'll do my best, Father Andrew.


00:31:55.209 --> 00:31:57.751
How's your brother


00:31:57.917 --> 00:32:00.834
at St. Francis Xavier?


00:32:01.001 --> 00:32:03.001
He came in No. 41


00:32:03.167 --> 00:32:05.001
in a class of 42.


00:32:05.167 --> 00:32:08.042
That's not bad, considering
he's always playing hooky.


00:32:39.834 --> 00:32:40.542
Where do you live?


00:32:40.751 --> 00:32:42.376
She lives next door to us.


00:32:42.542 --> 00:32:43.917
What's your name?


00:33:04.459 --> 00:33:07.084
Did you notice how pretty my partner is?


00:33:07.251 --> 00:33:09.209
Yours is so-so.


00:33:09.417 --> 00:33:10.917
I'm not as fussy as you.


00:33:11.084 --> 00:33:12.417
Good for you.


00:33:12.584 --> 00:33:14.501
Cut the crap, Sloppy Cat.


00:33:14.876 --> 00:33:15.584
This is my cousin's friend,


00:33:15.751 --> 00:33:17.251
Lau Lin-kong. He's from the U.K.


00:33:17.417 --> 00:33:18.376
Call me Kong.


00:33:18.542 --> 00:33:19.376
Hi, Kong.


00:33:19.542 --> 00:33:21.084
You danced very well.


00:33:21.251 --> 00:33:22.001
Thanks.


00:33:22.167 --> 00:33:25.167
From hanging out with the Brits?
No one dance like that in Hong Kong.


00:33:27.167 --> 00:33:28.834
Are you jealous?


00:33:30.209 --> 00:33:33.459
She likes a good looking guy, not you.


00:33:36.292 --> 00:33:39.292
Me? Jealous of him?
Girls fall for me right and left.


00:33:44.584 --> 00:33:48.834
I dare you to go over there
and see who she'll choose.


00:33:49.084 --> 00:33:51.501
Don't embarrass yourself, Sloppy Cat.


00:34:05.626 --> 00:34:08.209
You? She'll dance with you.


00:34:11.501 --> 00:34:13.084
Elvis Piggy comes.


00:34:13.334 --> 00:34:15.584
May I?


00:34:15.834 --> 00:34:17.459
You're both so cute.


00:34:17.626 --> 00:34:20.376
I can't decide.


00:34:51.042 --> 00:34:52.959
What? The power is out?


00:34:56.917 --> 00:34:58.167
May.


00:34:58.334 --> 00:34:59.709
Maybe next time.


00:34:59.917 --> 00:35:01.459
You think you're Elvis?


00:35:01.626 --> 00:35:03.917
I know Elvis of the Orient,


00:35:04.084 --> 00:35:06.292
but who are you?


00:35:11.292 --> 00:35:12.834
Move over.


00:35:16.167 --> 00:35:18.167
Margaret, you better come with me.


00:35:18.876 --> 00:35:20.376
You know this place?


00:35:20.542 --> 00:35:22.584
We all paid 50 cents to get in.


00:35:22.751 --> 00:35:25.292
My old man owns this joint.


00:35:25.459 --> 00:35:27.167
You're on my turf.


00:35:27.334 --> 00:35:30.126
I can't help it
if the girls prefer to dance with me.


00:35:30.292 --> 00:35:32.084
Get lost.


00:35:34.417 --> 00:35:35.751
Get lost.


00:35:35.959 --> 00:35:37.917
You want to pick a fight?


00:35:38.084 --> 00:35:40.084
Get lost if you know what's good for you


00:35:45.667 --> 00:35:47.001
Run.


00:35:48.084 --> 00:35:50.001
Don't let them get away.


00:35:52.626 --> 00:35:53.751
Get them.


00:35:56.959 --> 00:35:58.292
- Stop.
- Move away.


00:35:58.459 --> 00:36:01.584
Move or I'll run over you...


00:36:01.876 --> 00:36:04.084
- Hurry, Bruce.
- Move.


00:36:04.251 --> 00:36:06.667
This is for pedestrians.


00:36:09.917 --> 00:36:12.501
- Stop them.
- Don't move.


00:36:14.126 --> 00:36:15.792
Stop. Don't move.


00:36:16.792 --> 00:36:18.042
Run.


00:36:18.209 --> 00:36:20.001
Why did you ditch the bike?


00:36:20.167 --> 00:36:22.001
I can't ride a bike.


00:36:22.834 --> 00:36:23.917
They're coming.


00:36:24.084 --> 00:36:25.459
Meet up at the old joint.


00:36:27.709 --> 00:36:28.584
Stop.


00:36:28.751 --> 00:36:31.834
Hop on, Bruce. Hurry.


00:36:32.001 --> 00:36:33.126
Hurry. Don't let them get away.


00:36:44.459 --> 00:36:48.292
I came back for you, Phoenix.


00:36:48.876 --> 00:36:52.876
Bruce Lee can't ride a bike.


00:36:54.876 --> 00:36:57.042
Bruce Lee can't ride a bike.


00:37:06.001 --> 00:37:07.709
Bastard.


00:37:32.542 --> 00:37:35.626
Skinny, you really crushed them.


00:37:35.792 --> 00:37:38.626
Your cat claws weren't so bad either.


00:37:38.792 --> 00:37:40.751
You bet. I can claw 10 at a time.


00:37:40.917 --> 00:37:42.709
But nothing like Phoenix.


00:37:42.876 --> 00:37:44.876
He took on 20.


00:37:45.042 --> 00:37:47.251
You're flattering me.


00:37:48.376 --> 00:37:50.917
At least, nobody lost a tooth.


00:37:51.084 --> 00:37:52.167
It was my fault.


00:37:52.334 --> 00:37:54.209
If you hadn't come back for me,
we wouldn't be in such a mess.


00:37:54.376 --> 00:37:55.876
I'm sorry to have dragged you into this.


00:37:56.084 --> 00:37:59.084
We're buddies through thick and thin.


00:37:59.209 --> 00:38:03.459
We'll chase girls and spend some money.


00:38:03.626 --> 00:38:04.209
In your dreams.


00:38:04.376 --> 00:38:05.334
Hey, that hurts.


00:38:05.501 --> 00:38:06.292
Really?


00:38:06.459 --> 00:38:08.042
Yes.


00:38:08.209 --> 00:38:10.084
Does it hurt here?


00:38:12.334 --> 00:38:15.167
Come here...


00:38:15.334 --> 00:38:17.459
Get him.


00:38:20.209 --> 00:38:21.709
Stop.


00:38:34.209 --> 00:38:35.626
Go first.


00:38:50.126 --> 00:38:52.084
You stink.


00:39:33.876 --> 00:39:35.459
You went on a date?


00:39:35.626 --> 00:39:37.292
What about you? Another fight?


00:39:37.459 --> 00:39:39.292
You should talk.


00:39:39.459 --> 00:39:42.834
Father is performing in Cheung Chau tonight.


00:39:43.001 --> 00:39:44.334
No need to worry.


00:40:01.834 --> 00:40:05.251
Girls, why were you out so late?


00:40:06.084 --> 00:40:08.126
We went to the 7:30 show.


00:40:08.292 --> 00:40:09.959
We saw "Waterloo Bridge."


00:40:10.126 --> 00:40:13.292
it's after 11.


00:40:13.459 --> 00:40:16.501
Why didn't you come straight home?


00:40:17.251 --> 00:40:19.126
I'm sorry.


00:40:23.876 --> 00:40:28.334
Look at you. You're in black and blue again.


00:40:29.084 --> 00:40:30.167
It's not his fault.


00:40:30.334 --> 00:40:34.084
I picked the fight. He was bailing me out.


00:40:34.251 --> 00:40:36.126
Skinny.


00:40:36.626 --> 00:40:38.376
I'm not asking you.


00:40:41.001 --> 00:40:42.542
I'm responsible for my own mistakes.


00:40:42.709 --> 00:40:45.209
I'll kowtow to the ancestors.


00:40:45.709 --> 00:40:47.376
No, it was my fault.


00:40:47.542 --> 00:40:49.334
No, it was mine.


00:40:49.501 --> 00:40:50.959
It was my fault.


00:40:51.126 --> 00:40:55.376
- I'm sorry, Mom.
- I'm sorry.


00:40:55.542 --> 00:40:59.042
- I'm sorry.
- I'm sorry.


00:40:59.251 --> 00:41:02.251
- It was my fault.
- I'm sorry.


00:41:02.376 --> 00:41:05.417
Get down, Robert.


00:41:06.042 --> 00:41:07.917
- I'm sorry.
- Kowtow to the ancestors.


00:41:08.084 --> 00:41:11.751
- I'm sorry.
- It was my fault.


00:41:23.376 --> 00:41:25.584
I want you to learn,


00:41:26.292 --> 00:41:28.542
not just to kowtow.


00:41:29.751 --> 00:41:33.834
Your Father works hard for this family.


00:41:34.417 --> 00:41:41.501
You get out of hand when he's away.


00:41:42.792 --> 00:41:46.001
You're all being insensible.


00:41:49.209 --> 00:41:54.459
How can you face your Father?


00:41:56.584 --> 00:41:59.251
Sorry, Mom. We'll be good.


00:42:00.542 --> 00:42:02.251
Sorry, Mom.


00:42:02.417 --> 00:42:04.459
We won't go out at night anymore.


00:42:04.626 --> 00:42:06.542
We won't go out at night.


00:42:13.792 --> 00:42:15.626
There's more, Miss Phoebe.


00:42:15.792 --> 00:42:17.042
Thanks.


00:42:17.751 --> 00:42:19.126
This is for you, Phoenix.


00:42:19.292 --> 00:42:20.126
No thanks.


00:42:20.292 --> 00:42:22.376
It's for your eye. Not for you to eat.


00:42:22.542 --> 00:42:23.917
Your eye is swollen.


00:42:24.084 --> 00:42:25.417
Save it for your ass.


00:42:25.667 --> 00:42:26.626
Let me do it.


00:42:26.792 --> 00:42:29.751
Stop it. Hurry up, we'll be late for school.


00:42:29.917 --> 00:42:31.876
Hurry, Robert. Finish that egg.


00:42:32.584 --> 00:42:33.834
Open the door.


00:42:35.042 --> 00:42:36.626
Open the door.


00:42:39.792 --> 00:42:41.667
This is a warrant


00:42:41.834 --> 00:42:44.876
to Search your house.


00:42:45.459 --> 00:42:46.959
Get in.


00:42:47.167 --> 00:42:48.292
I've been here before.


00:42:48.459 --> 00:42:50.001
Where's the famous Lee Hoi-chuen?


00:42:50.167 --> 00:42:53.167
What do you want? He's not here.


00:42:54.376 --> 00:42:57.001
Please have a seat, Mr Robinson.


00:42:57.167 --> 00:42:58.417
Serve tea.


00:42:58.584 --> 00:43:00.876
Want a smoke?


00:43:06.542 --> 00:43:08.001
A cigarette


00:43:08.167 --> 00:43:11.042
won't make your trouble go away.


00:43:12.751 --> 00:43:15.709
If your husband is an ordinary smoker,


00:43:15.876 --> 00:43:18.459
it'd be simple, but


00:43:21.334 --> 00:43:22.834
he's into that...


00:43:23.001 --> 00:43:24.542
Men, take action. Search the house.


00:43:24.709 --> 00:43:25.417
Yes, sir.


00:43:25.584 --> 00:43:26.542
What are you looking for?


00:43:26.709 --> 00:43:28.751
You know damn well.


00:43:29.209 --> 00:43:30.501
Phoenix.


00:43:30.792 --> 00:43:32.542
I know you. Traitor.


00:43:32.709 --> 00:43:34.167
What are you doing here?


00:43:36.042 --> 00:43:37.542
I know you too.


00:43:37.709 --> 00:43:38.876
You're the old maid.


00:43:39.042 --> 00:43:40.876
Don't argue with him, Auntie.


00:43:51.292 --> 00:43:52.792
Hong Kong is British colony.


00:43:52.959 --> 00:43:54.584
You are under British law.


00:43:54.751 --> 00:43:59.376
Smoking opium is a very serious offense,
do you understand?


00:44:19.751 --> 00:44:22.417
My husband always smokes when he is performing.


00:44:22.584 --> 00:44:27.459
This is a very common habit
among all entertainers.


00:44:27.751 --> 00:44:29.084
For your information, Sir.


00:44:29.251 --> 00:44:35.126
Smoking opium is a tradition that
was left from the last Chinese empire.


00:44:35.292 --> 00:44:37.334
The British caused the Opium War, didn't they?


00:44:37.501 --> 00:44:38.751
Shut up, Phoenix.


00:44:46.542 --> 00:44:51.209
Mr Robinson, is there any way at all


00:44:51.376 --> 00:44:53.126
that you could perhaps...


00:44:53.292 --> 00:44:55.459
over the situation?


00:44:57.959 --> 00:45:01.292
Of course.


00:45:02.626 --> 00:45:06.959
But that'll depend on you.


00:45:13.126 --> 00:45:14.501
Here. Treat yourself to a meal.


00:45:16.001 --> 00:45:19.667
We have a very big precinct.


00:45:19.834 --> 00:45:21.417
Not to mention I don't fancy tea.


00:45:21.584 --> 00:45:23.542
The boys prefer to go drinking.


00:45:23.667 --> 00:45:25.751
How much do you want?


00:45:26.542 --> 00:45:28.542
Let's go straight to the chase.


00:45:28.667 --> 00:45:30.542
At least cough up a brown one.


00:45:30.667 --> 00:45:31.834
That's too greedy.


00:45:32.001 --> 00:45:33.709
$500 can buy a flat in Sham Shui Po.


00:45:33.876 --> 00:45:35.959
It's your call.


00:45:36.126 --> 00:45:38.876
Why didn't they shoot a running dog like you?


00:45:39.042 --> 00:45:40.709
That's all I have.


00:45:44.834 --> 00:45:46.042
That'll do, Sir.


00:45:46.209 --> 00:45:48.292
Let's go.


00:45:48.542 --> 00:45:50.751
Shall we confiscate the evidence, Sir?


00:45:50.917 --> 00:45:52.417
What evidence?


00:45:52.709 --> 00:45:54.834
We found nothing here today.


00:45:56.251 --> 00:45:57.667
Ladies.


00:46:00.709 --> 00:46:02.334
See you later.


00:46:10.126 --> 00:46:11.626
Mother.


00:46:37.126 --> 00:46:39.167
What about your voice?


00:47:13.626 --> 00:47:14.501
Want a smoke?


00:47:14.667 --> 00:47:15.792
It's bad for you. You should quit.


00:47:15.959 --> 00:47:18.501
This is nothing compared to my Father's addiction.


00:47:18.667 --> 00:47:21.001
When I'm bored,


00:47:21.167 --> 00:47:24.376
smoking helps me think.


00:47:24.667 --> 00:47:26.501
What's taking her so long?


00:47:26.667 --> 00:47:30.084
A girl should keep us waiting.


00:47:32.459 --> 00:47:33.917
Here she is.


00:47:37.959 --> 00:47:40.167
- You...
- I'm sorry.


00:47:40.334 --> 00:47:42.376
Relax. It's only right for a girl


00:47:42.542 --> 00:47:43.959
to keep a guy waiting.


00:47:44.126 --> 00:47:46.251
Let's go see "Rebel Without a Cause."


00:47:46.417 --> 00:47:47.917
James Dean is in it.


00:47:48.084 --> 00:47:49.167
That's what I want to see, too.


00:47:49.334 --> 00:47:50.334
Are you Bruce Lee?


00:47:51.709 --> 00:47:52.751
Yes.


00:47:52.917 --> 00:47:54.459
Can I have your autograph?


00:47:54.626 --> 00:47:56.709
I'm a huge fan.


00:48:01.084 --> 00:48:02.126
Margaret, can I have yours too?


00:48:02.292 --> 00:48:03.501
My boyfriend likes you.


00:48:03.667 --> 00:48:04.792
Sure.


00:48:05.084 --> 00:48:06.959
- Thank you.
- Thank you.


00:48:07.667 --> 00:48:09.042
You both have fans?


00:48:09.209 --> 00:48:10.459
Why not?


00:48:10.626 --> 00:48:12.834
I've never been to a studio.


00:48:13.001 --> 00:48:14.834
When can you give me a tour?


00:48:15.001 --> 00:48:16.376
- We'll do it now.
- Great. Let's go.


00:48:16.542 --> 00:48:17.709
Let me drive.


00:48:18.001 --> 00:48:22.042
We're giving you the grand tour.


00:48:22.209 --> 00:48:25.042
You'll see


00:48:25.209 --> 00:48:27.167
the great Bruce Lee in action.


00:48:27.334 --> 00:48:30.501
You'll see Wong Fei-hung. He's my friend.


00:48:35.709 --> 00:48:37.042
Great


00:48:38.167 --> 00:48:39.542
Phoenix.


00:48:40.542 --> 00:48:41.876
Ready.


00:48:42.042 --> 00:48:42.792
Scene 2.


00:48:42.959 --> 00:48:44.709
Action.


00:48:45.959 --> 00:48:47.334
Si-fung.


00:48:48.251 --> 00:48:49.542
Si-fung.


00:48:49.709 --> 00:48:51.126
What is it, Master Chung?


00:48:51.292 --> 00:48:53.417
Mother knows you're leaving.


00:48:53.584 --> 00:48:56.292
She wants me to give you $100.


00:48:56.459 --> 00:48:58.584
No, thank you.


00:48:58.751 --> 00:49:01.042
Please give it back to her.


00:49:01.667 --> 00:49:03.209
That means you're angry with us.


00:49:04.667 --> 00:49:06.792
I'm sorry about what happened today.


00:49:07.417 --> 00:49:09.751
I didn't mean it.


00:49:09.917 --> 00:49:13.001
I'm sorry about what happened today.


00:49:14.001 --> 00:49:18.917
Master Chung, take me...


00:49:19.084 --> 00:49:23.834
Si-fung, let's go inside the woodshed.


00:49:25.251 --> 00:49:28.167
Cut. Who's laughing?


00:49:28.334 --> 00:49:30.251
- I'm sorry.
- Sorry.


00:49:30.417 --> 00:49:33.251
You again? Stop messing around.


00:49:33.417 --> 00:49:35.667
Let's do it again.


00:49:35.876 --> 00:49:38.209
It's him. I'm not to blame.


00:49:41.709 --> 00:49:44.417
I'm romancing her and you're laughing.


00:49:44.584 --> 00:49:46.876
Your look not only makes me laugh.


00:49:47.042 --> 00:49:48.251
It makes me want to puke.


00:49:48.417 --> 00:49:50.584
Want to puke now?


00:49:51.792 --> 00:49:53.084
This is boring...


00:49:53.251 --> 00:49:54.126
Anything more exciting?


00:49:54.292 --> 00:49:56.084
Melodrama is definitely boring.


00:49:56.251 --> 00:49:58.417
I'll show you something awesome.


00:49:58.584 --> 00:50:00.334
Let's go.


00:50:01.751 --> 00:50:04.459
This is another world.


00:50:04.959 --> 00:50:06.251
This is not only a studio.


00:50:06.542 --> 00:50:08.834
It's also a playground.


00:50:09.042 --> 00:50:11.209
Phoenix, let's go see Chun Siu-lei.


00:50:11.376 --> 00:50:13.001
Who's that?


00:50:13.167 --> 00:50:15.542
She's the lead in "Lady Tan Kei"?


00:50:15.709 --> 00:50:17.209
Skinny, you are such a loser.


00:50:17.376 --> 00:50:18.959
You're a lecherous cat.


00:50:19.542 --> 00:50:20.334
Wong Fei-hung Vs Shek Kin.


00:50:20.501 --> 00:50:21.501
That's Shek Kin.


00:50:21.667 --> 00:50:22.626
Where's Wong Fei-hung?


00:50:22.834 --> 00:50:25.834
Just focus on me.


00:50:30.834 --> 00:50:31.584
Kin,


00:50:31.751 --> 00:50:33.751
you guys will kick down the door.


00:50:33.917 --> 00:50:36.501
Wah, your Leung Foon comes from over there.


00:50:36.667 --> 00:50:38.626
Let's do it.


00:50:38.834 --> 00:50:39.959
Wait.


00:50:40.126 --> 00:50:41.417
Shall we do the fight scene as well?


00:50:41.584 --> 00:50:42.459
Of course.


00:50:42.626 --> 00:50:44.459
You don't scare me.


00:50:44.626 --> 00:50:47.626
I won't go easy on you.


00:50:50.876 --> 00:50:53.584
I'm a martial artist too.


00:50:53.751 --> 00:50:56.334
Are you ready?


00:50:56.501 --> 00:50:57.251
Anytime.


00:50:57.417 --> 00:50:58.334
Come on.


00:50:58.501 --> 00:50:59.959
Everyone, stand by.


00:51:00.126 --> 00:51:01.709
- it's rolling
- Here we go.


00:51:01.876 --> 00:51:03.876
Ready. Camera.


00:51:08.792 --> 00:51:09.959
If you won't mind your own business,


00:51:10.126 --> 00:51:11.751
you must deal with me.


00:51:16.042 --> 00:51:16.959
Who are you?


00:51:17.126 --> 00:51:18.334
My Master is in Guangzhou.


00:51:18.501 --> 00:51:21.376
You can take it up with me.


00:51:22.751 --> 00:51:25.167
I'm here to settle a score.


00:51:25.334 --> 00:51:27.834
Wise up and step aside,


00:51:28.001 --> 00:51:29.792
or else...


00:51:31.542 --> 00:51:33.376
Tear down the Po Chi Lam sign.


00:51:36.709 --> 00:51:37.834
Here we go.


00:51:38.001 --> 00:51:39.209
This is the notorious Uncle Kin.


00:51:43.042 --> 00:51:44.709
How dare you.


00:51:47.876 --> 00:51:49.209
Uncle Kin is so cool.


00:51:53.334 --> 00:51:54.876
Stop.


00:51:56.917 --> 00:51:58.251
What now?


00:51:58.876 --> 00:52:01.084
You're not supposed to grab my face.


00:52:01.251 --> 00:52:04.251
I got carried away. It looks better that way.


00:52:04.417 --> 00:52:05.626
I have another shoot.


00:52:05.792 --> 00:52:07.584
Don't mess up my face.


00:52:07.751 --> 00:52:10.042
Come on, let's do it again.


00:52:10.209 --> 00:52:11.584
Let's...


00:52:12.376 --> 00:52:13.959
Mr Iron Man?


00:52:16.626 --> 00:52:18.042
He's rusty.


00:52:18.751 --> 00:52:21.209
Chun Siu-lei isn't here or I'll introduce you.


00:52:21.376 --> 00:52:22.626
- Uncle Wah.
- Uncle Wah.


00:52:22.792 --> 00:52:25.376
Bruce, can I take a picture with him?


00:52:25.542 --> 00:52:27.959
Can my friend take a picture with you?


00:52:28.084 --> 00:52:29.251
Sure.


00:52:29.417 --> 00:52:30.876
I'll get that.


00:52:31.959 --> 00:52:34.292
1,2, 3.


00:52:34.667 --> 00:52:36.251
I'm counting on you for tomorrow's shoot.


00:52:36.417 --> 00:52:37.709
- OK.
- Better fight well.


00:52:37.876 --> 00:52:40.084
- Uncle Kin.
- You can count on me.


00:52:40.251 --> 00:52:42.959
Getting yourself in trouble again?


00:52:43.126 --> 00:52:44.959
No, I'm here to learn something.


00:52:45.126 --> 00:52:46.126
Uncle Kin.


00:52:46.376 --> 00:52:48.751
I'll take a picture for you.


00:52:48.959 --> 00:52:50.084
Thanks, Uncle Kin.


00:52:50.251 --> 00:52:51.292
Phoenix.


00:52:51.459 --> 00:52:53.459
You boys are showing off


00:52:53.626 --> 00:52:55.792
in Kowloon City, eh?


00:52:56.001 --> 00:52:57.709
- No.
- No.


00:52:57.876 --> 00:52:59.459
Look over here.


00:52:59.626 --> 00:53:00.292
Tigers...


00:53:00.459 --> 00:53:01.292
of...


00:53:01.459 --> 00:53:02.001
Kowloon...


00:53:02.167 --> 00:53:03.751
City.


00:53:05.584 --> 00:53:07.876
- See you around.
- Thanks.


00:53:08.042 --> 00:53:10.251
Uncle Kin, can I take a picture of you?


00:53:10.626 --> 00:53:12.209
With him?


00:53:13.709 --> 00:53:15.126
I'll do it.


00:53:15.292 --> 00:53:16.542
You're too good a fighter.


00:53:16.709 --> 00:53:18.376
Who else?


00:53:18.959 --> 00:53:21.542
Uncle Kin, I really admire you.


00:53:25.834 --> 00:53:26.626
Don't laugh.


00:53:26.792 --> 00:53:29.959
Look over here, 1, 2, 3.


00:53:30.126 --> 00:53:32.209
Tigers.


00:53:32.751 --> 00:53:34.167
Brats.


00:53:36.126 --> 00:53:37.334
Thank you.


00:53:37.667 --> 00:53:40.334
Let me buy you a drink.


00:53:40.501 --> 00:53:44.292
No thanks, I'm playing dominoes.


00:53:44.459 --> 00:53:46.209
Next time, drop by my place.


00:53:46.376 --> 00:53:48.542
- Alright.
- it's a deal.


00:54:03.584 --> 00:54:06.542
The second day of the Chinese New Year
was always rowdy for us,


00:54:06.709 --> 00:54:09.792
because it was also Auntie Ngan's birthday.


00:54:09.959 --> 00:54:12.917
Father's friends from work


00:54:13.084 --> 00:54:15.042
would drop by.


00:54:21.792 --> 00:54:23.417
You two have been making fun
of Big Sis, haven't you.


00:54:23.584 --> 00:54:24.834
- You scared us.
- Got away.


00:54:25.001 --> 00:54:26.001
Just ignore him.


00:54:26.167 --> 00:54:28.542
Tell Wah to take it easy.


00:54:28.709 --> 00:54:32.084
Filming night and day is bad for his health.


00:54:32.251 --> 00:54:35.084
I know, that's why I'm making him...


00:54:35.251 --> 00:54:36.459
sleep in right now.


00:54:36.626 --> 00:54:40.417
He should spend more time with his family.


00:54:40.584 --> 00:54:41.584
Sixty Thousand.


00:54:41.876 --> 00:54:43.084
You're so right.


00:54:43.251 --> 00:54:45.376
Pearl is back and he has no time for her.


00:54:45.542 --> 00:54:46.376
Really?


00:54:46.542 --> 00:54:49.667
Tell him there's always money to earn.


00:54:49.834 --> 00:54:51.584
Am I right, Mui Yee?


00:54:51.751 --> 00:54:53.042
Game.


00:54:53.209 --> 00:54:54.459
Not when I'm on a draw.


00:54:54.626 --> 00:54:57.167
- You're missing a tile.
- What?


00:54:57.334 --> 00:54:59.251
Because you couldn't


00:54:59.417 --> 00:55:00.751
take your eyes off her.


00:55:00.917 --> 00:55:02.042
You're already wearing glasses.


00:55:02.209 --> 00:55:03.751
I knew I had a 6 Circles. Where did it go?


00:55:03.917 --> 00:55:05.709
Where did it go?


00:55:06.584 --> 00:55:07.876
Pay up.


00:55:08.126 --> 00:55:10.334
Come and eat a birthday bun.


00:55:13.917 --> 00:55:17.626
Let's eat, we'll play later.


00:55:18.751 --> 00:55:21.001
- Happy birthday.
- Happy birthday.


00:55:26.584 --> 00:55:30.251
- Happy birthday, Auntie Ngan.
- Happy birthday.


00:55:32.542 --> 00:55:33.417
Master Phoenix is back.


00:55:33.584 --> 00:55:35.751
Kong, come with me for red packets.


00:55:35.917 --> 00:55:37.042
Phoenix.


00:55:39.917 --> 00:55:40.459
Auntie Ngan.


00:55:40.667 --> 00:55:44.209
You're home. Have a birthday bun.


00:55:44.792 --> 00:55:45.292
Happy birthday.


00:55:45.542 --> 00:55:46.959
Kong, this is my Auntie Ngan.


00:55:47.126 --> 00:55:48.292
Happy birthday.


00:55:48.459 --> 00:55:49.292
Thanks.


00:55:49.459 --> 00:55:51.167
Go inside and say hello.


00:55:53.167 --> 00:55:54.042
Thanks.


00:55:54.626 --> 00:55:57.167
- Father.
- Phoneix.


00:55:57.876 --> 00:55:59.167
This is my good friend Lau Lin-kong.


00:55:59.334 --> 00:56:01.292
Kung Hei Fat Choy.


00:56:01.459 --> 00:56:02.626
Give him a red packet.


00:56:02.792 --> 00:56:05.292
- Come.
- Thanks. Kung Hei Fat Choy.


00:56:06.459 --> 00:56:08.042
Kung Hei Fat Choy. Thanks.


00:56:08.209 --> 00:56:09.584
This is for you, Phoenix.


00:56:09.751 --> 00:56:11.501
- Auntie Tso.
- Phoenix, Come here.


00:56:12.626 --> 00:56:16.042
This is from me and Uncle Wah.


00:56:16.459 --> 00:56:16.751
Thanks, Auntie Tso.


00:56:16.917 --> 00:56:19.501
Put it away properly and be good.


00:56:21.334 --> 00:56:24.792
Margaret's been waiting for you all morning.


00:56:24.959 --> 00:56:26.501
Come here, Kong


00:56:27.834 --> 00:56:28.917
Peter. Margaret.


00:56:29.084 --> 00:56:30.792
I've waited for you all morning.


00:56:30.959 --> 00:56:33.417
Meet my elder brother Peter and my sisters.


00:56:33.584 --> 00:56:34.542
Hello.


00:56:34.709 --> 00:56:37.042
You have a big family.


00:56:37.417 --> 00:56:38.501
Where's Skinny?


00:56:38.667 --> 00:56:40.126
In the back.


00:56:40.292 --> 00:56:41.917
- Let's go get him.
- OK.


00:56:42.084 --> 00:56:43.167
Play with me, Sloppy Cat.


00:56:43.334 --> 00:56:45.501
OK, let the girls stay here.


00:56:45.667 --> 00:56:46.876
We'll go outside.


00:56:49.209 --> 00:56:51.167
You barely finished 4 rounds.


00:56:51.334 --> 00:56:54.376
Chor-fan wants me to relay a message.


00:56:54.542 --> 00:56:56.542
Stay away from sloppy films.


00:56:56.709 --> 00:57:01.001
Make more films for Union and
do your snare for qualify Cantonese films.


00:57:01.876 --> 00:57:04.251
I'm really flattered, but as you know,


00:57:04.417 --> 00:57:08.626
I've 30 mouths to feed. I must keep working.


00:57:09.667 --> 00:57:11.334
Tell Chor-fan,


00:57:11.501 --> 00:57:15.542
I'll be there if he needs me.


00:57:15.709 --> 00:57:17.792
Alright. I have to go.


00:57:17.959 --> 00:57:19.376
- Kung Hei Fat Choy.
- Kung Hei Fat Choy.


00:57:19.584 --> 00:57:21.709
Come on.


00:57:21.876 --> 00:57:23.709
Bet more, win more.


00:57:24.001 --> 00:57:26.042
I bet on everything.


00:57:26.542 --> 00:57:28.542
Bet on it, bet on it.


00:57:30.042 --> 00:57:31.542
No more bets.


00:57:31.876 --> 00:57:35.584
- Come on.
- Come on.


00:57:35.751 --> 00:57:39.792
All chickens. Clean sweep, thank you.


00:57:39.959 --> 00:57:41.417
Kung Hei Fat Choy.


00:57:43.626 --> 00:57:44.501
Skinny.


00:57:44.667 --> 00:57:45.959
You're here.


00:57:46.126 --> 00:57:47.834
Let's play.


00:57:48.001 --> 00:57:49.251
You like to gamble?


00:57:49.417 --> 00:57:52.584
No, only for the New Year.


00:57:52.751 --> 00:57:53.959
Come and sit.


00:57:55.209 --> 00:57:57.167
- Kung Hei Fat Choy.
- Kung Hei Fat Choy.


00:57:57.334 --> 00:57:58.959
What a crowd.


00:57:59.126 --> 00:58:01.292
- Your daughter?
- Kung Hei Fat Choy.


00:58:01.709 --> 00:58:02.751
Yes, say hello to Auntie.


00:58:02.917 --> 00:58:03.751
What's your name?


00:58:03.917 --> 00:58:06.084
Bobo Fung. I'm 4 years old.


00:58:06.292 --> 00:58:10.542
I wish Uncle Chuen a prosperous New Year.


00:58:12.084 --> 00:58:15.292
Thank you. Give her a red packet.


00:58:15.417 --> 00:58:17.584
- Thank you.
- Thank you.


00:58:17.751 --> 00:58:18.542
Let's play there, ok?


00:58:18.709 --> 00:58:20.292
Come with me.


00:58:21.542 --> 00:58:24.292
Why bring all this?


00:58:24.417 --> 00:58:27.292
It's nothing. Where's Phoenix?


00:58:27.501 --> 00:58:30.209
In the back.


00:58:30.376 --> 00:58:31.626
They ain't kids anymore.


00:58:31.792 --> 00:58:33.959
I envy you. Your kids are all grown up.


00:58:34.126 --> 00:58:37.126
You'll be off the hook soon. Mine is only 4.


00:58:37.292 --> 00:58:40.626
She's smart and cute.


00:58:40.792 --> 00:58:43.167
Put her in a film.


00:58:44.042 --> 00:58:46.126
Right. Keep it in the family.


00:58:47.084 --> 00:58:51.084
I'll tell you the story about Snow White.


00:58:51.251 --> 00:58:52.834
- Come on.
- Believe it or not.


00:58:53.001 --> 00:58:55.334
3 Chickens again.


00:58:56.667 --> 00:58:58.042
What are you doing here?


00:58:58.209 --> 00:59:00.251
I've been here since I was a kid.


00:59:00.417 --> 00:59:02.667
I know them very well.


00:59:02.834 --> 00:59:04.709
Who's talking? Your house is so big.


00:59:04.876 --> 00:59:06.501
When will you give us a tour?


00:59:06.667 --> 00:59:09.751
There's nobody there.


00:59:11.417 --> 00:59:12.501
What about your parents?


00:59:12.834 --> 00:59:15.084
They're never in Hong Kong.


00:59:15.251 --> 00:59:18.001
Even if they are, they're never home.


00:59:18.167 --> 00:59:20.459
It's always just me and the servants.


00:59:20.626 --> 00:59:23.251
That's better than me. My house is tiny.


00:59:23.417 --> 00:59:24.876
I can't stay there.


00:59:25.042 --> 00:59:26.167
I like it better here.


00:59:26.334 --> 00:59:29.167
Let's all go inside for a picture.


00:59:29.376 --> 00:59:31.167
- Come on.
- Let's go.


00:59:34.001 --> 00:59:36.917
3, 2, 1. Smile.


00:59:42.042 --> 00:59:44.001
No need to go to work today?


00:59:44.167 --> 00:59:45.542
A leading man can decide


00:59:45.709 --> 00:59:47.501
when to go to work.


00:59:47.667 --> 00:59:48.792
- Really?
- I will go to work at 3.


00:59:48.959 --> 00:59:50.667
What about Skinny and Kong?


00:59:50.876 --> 00:59:52.584
We're here to work.


00:59:52.751 --> 00:59:55.626
You think it's really fun to watch filming?


00:59:56.042 --> 00:59:56.876
Today will be awesome.


00:59:57.042 --> 01:00:00.709
Uncle Wah and Yu So-chow are filming a wuxia film.


01:00:00.876 --> 01:00:02.251
Keep watching and be quiet.


01:00:03.876 --> 01:00:04.876
Action.


01:00:05.209 --> 01:00:06.251
Now that you have completed your training,


01:00:06.417 --> 01:00:08.542
you may seek revenge.


01:00:08.709 --> 01:00:09.876
But remember...


01:00:10.042 --> 01:00:13.542
you must always help the needy.


01:00:13.709 --> 01:00:16.084
Master, thanks for rescuing me 18 years ago.


01:00:16.251 --> 01:00:20.334
I'll find my parents' killer and avenge them.


01:00:24.542 --> 01:00:26.459
Cut. Where's the dubbing artist?


01:00:26.626 --> 01:00:28.001
- Dubbing artist.
- Where is she?


01:00:28.584 --> 01:00:29.501
Right here.


01:00:29.834 --> 01:00:31.376
I'm sorry.


01:00:31.542 --> 01:00:32.751
- No problem.
- No problem.


01:00:32.917 --> 01:00:34.042
I'm sorry.


01:00:34.584 --> 01:00:35.626
Let's do it again.


01:00:35.792 --> 01:00:37.584
Ready. Action.


01:00:37.751 --> 01:00:40.917
You're leaving?


01:00:41.167 --> 01:00:43.042
I'll leave you two alone.


01:00:44.417 --> 01:00:46.292
I don't know


01:00:46.459 --> 01:00:48.376
when I'll be back.


01:00:48.542 --> 01:00:52.084
No, I'll tell Father I'm going with you.


01:00:52.251 --> 01:00:53.792
Yu So-chow is so amazing.


01:00:53.959 --> 01:00:56.667
I think the dubbing artist is more amazing.


01:00:56.834 --> 01:00:59.292
Cut. Done. Get ready for the next scene.


01:00:59.459 --> 01:01:01.251
Uncle Wah & Ms Yu, we are waiting for you.


01:01:01.417 --> 01:01:02.501
Be right there.


01:01:02.667 --> 01:01:04.292
Sorry, Mr Koo, they want me for another film.


01:01:04.459 --> 01:01:07.542
They're filming "The Story of Wang Ying" next door.
Let's go watch.


01:01:07.709 --> 01:01:08.709
No.


01:01:08.876 --> 01:01:10.084
Come on.


01:01:10.251 --> 01:01:13.751
I'm tired. I need a break.


01:01:16.084 --> 01:01:19.501
- Hurry.
- Go change.


01:01:19.626 --> 01:01:21.417
Give me your best. Lights off.


01:01:25.251 --> 01:01:29.209
Miss Wang, I wish you'll cooperate with us.


01:01:30.626 --> 01:01:33.501
If I didn't why else


01:01:33.626 --> 01:01:35.959
did I call you, Inspector?


01:03:10.626 --> 01:03:13.167
Are you OK?


01:03:35.167 --> 01:03:36.001
Bruce.


01:03:36.167 --> 01:03:37.042
What?


01:03:37.209 --> 01:03:38.834
Come, sign your name.


01:03:39.001 --> 01:03:40.834
You're selling my autographs again?


01:03:41.001 --> 01:03:42.959
Hurry. We're waiting for you.


01:03:43.126 --> 01:03:44.501
That's my signature. Isn't it nice?


01:03:44.667 --> 01:03:45.626
It's your turn.


01:03:45.751 --> 01:03:47.292
Come here.


01:03:47.459 --> 01:03:48.626
Today is Mom's birthday.


01:03:48.792 --> 01:03:50.126
We're giving her an English album.


01:03:50.292 --> 01:03:53.001
I thought Robert's


01:03:53.167 --> 01:03:54.876
selling my autograph.


01:03:55.084 --> 01:03:55.917
Who do you think you are? Tso Tat-wah?


01:03:56.084 --> 01:03:57.501
Who'd want your autograph?


01:03:58.001 --> 01:04:01.376
Someday,


01:04:02.126 --> 01:04:04.584
the entire world will want my autograph.


01:04:07.126 --> 01:04:07.959
Who are we missing?


01:04:08.126 --> 01:04:09.667
Me.


01:04:14.292 --> 01:04:15.626
Like motif writing.


01:04:15.792 --> 01:04:17.376
What do you know?


01:04:17.542 --> 01:04:19.292
It's ugly.


01:04:19.459 --> 01:04:22.292
Agnes, does Uncle Wah have a daughter?


01:04:22.459 --> 01:04:25.751
Why don't you ask Mrs Tso?


01:04:39.709 --> 01:04:42.001
They buy the soy sauce, I buy the chicken.


01:04:42.167 --> 01:04:46.709
They buy you an album, I pay for the machine.


01:04:48.459 --> 01:04:52.001
It's in English. You understand this?


01:04:52.167 --> 01:04:54.167
As long as you like it.


01:05:10.001 --> 01:05:11.334
Happy birthday.


01:05:12.292 --> 01:05:15.001
I thought you forgot.


01:05:16.251 --> 01:05:17.709
No way.


01:05:18.709 --> 01:05:23.084
I remember it better than my lines.


01:05:25.876 --> 01:05:27.334
20 years ago,


01:05:28.209 --> 01:05:30.626
we pledged our love on your birthday.


01:05:32.042 --> 01:05:34.376
These last 20 years have been tough oh you.


01:05:37.834 --> 01:05:41.834
You come from a rich family and
married an actor like me


01:05:42.834 --> 01:05:44.876
and raised my children.


01:05:46.667 --> 01:05:47.876
Thank you.


01:05:48.042 --> 01:05:49.292
What for?


01:05:50.542 --> 01:05:55.834
You worked hard for this family too.


01:05:57.376 --> 01:06:00.917
Like I always say, the family must...


01:06:01.084 --> 01:06:05.292
Live happily together.


01:06:06.626 --> 01:06:08.501
I "larve" you.


01:06:13.251 --> 01:06:15.876
It's I "love" you.


01:06:17.751 --> 01:06:21.417
Those brats are listening outside our door.


01:06:28.376 --> 01:06:33.084
I love you.


01:06:33.417 --> 01:06:35.584
Who taught you to say something so corny?


01:06:37.376 --> 01:06:39.001
Leung Sing-po.


01:06:39.584 --> 01:06:41.792
I love you.


01:07:39.042 --> 01:07:40.917
Why are you following me?


01:07:41.459 --> 01:07:42.959
I'm not.


01:07:43.292 --> 01:07:47.042
You want to say something?


01:07:50.001 --> 01:07:51.417
You're Uncle Wah's daughter?


01:07:51.626 --> 01:07:54.251
You're Bruce Lee, a.k.a. Phoenix.


01:07:54.417 --> 01:07:55.334
How did you know?


01:07:55.501 --> 01:07:57.667
Do you know I'm one year older than you?


01:07:59.876 --> 01:08:02.167
Say hi to Uncle Chuen and Auntie Grace.


01:08:02.792 --> 01:08:04.167
Bye.


01:08:22.376 --> 01:08:23.834
Thank you, Bruce.


01:08:24.792 --> 01:08:25.751
For what?


01:08:27.751 --> 01:08:30.501
I don't particularly enjoy making friends.


01:08:31.917 --> 01:08:34.501
I never had any good friends.


01:08:34.792 --> 01:08:35.917
But I have one now


01:08:36.042 --> 01:08:39.667
since I met you.


01:08:40.501 --> 01:08:41.709
Like you took me to the studio.


01:08:41.876 --> 01:08:43.959
I really had fun.


01:08:44.376 --> 01:08:47.542
And this food... it's delicious.


01:08:48.251 --> 01:08:51.001
If you didn't bring me,


01:08:51.167 --> 01:08:52.334
I'll never know


01:08:52.501 --> 01:08:54.501
Hong Kong has such a place at night.


01:08:54.667 --> 01:08:55.876
Don't exaggerate.


01:08:56.042 --> 01:08:57.001
Really?


01:08:57.167 --> 01:08:58.251
You're not so bad yourself.


01:08:58.417 --> 01:09:01.209
You've been abroad,


01:09:01.376 --> 01:09:05.376
unlike us parochial local boys.


01:09:05.542 --> 01:09:07.459
Come on.


01:09:08.584 --> 01:09:09.959
Cheers.


01:09:19.501 --> 01:09:20.959
Tell me about your dream.


01:09:21.751 --> 01:09:24.501
My dream? I'm greedy.


01:09:25.917 --> 01:09:27.917
I want to do something no one's done before.


01:09:28.751 --> 01:09:30.792
I want the world to know who I am.


01:09:32.584 --> 01:09:34.001
You're in the movies.


01:09:34.167 --> 01:09:36.751
Many people in Hong Kong know


01:09:36.917 --> 01:09:38.334
Bruce Lee.


01:09:38.501 --> 01:09:39.751
That's not enough.


01:09:39.917 --> 01:09:43.376
I'm talking about worldwide.


01:09:45.417 --> 01:09:46.792
That's too greedy.


01:09:49.251 --> 01:09:50.417
What about you?


01:09:51.334 --> 01:09:52.251
Me?


01:09:53.292 --> 01:09:58.542
I wanted to be many things: a scientist,


01:09:58.792 --> 01:10:00.917
a pilot, etc, etc.


01:10:01.084 --> 01:10:02.626
Now that I'm older,


01:10:02.792 --> 01:10:05.292
I know I've been naive.


01:10:05.459 --> 01:10:07.667
Nothing is ever that simple.


01:10:09.501 --> 01:10:12.417
I should be practical, find a girl


01:10:14.167 --> 01:10:16.042
and be nice to her,


01:10:16.667 --> 01:10:18.459
take over my Dad's business,


01:10:18.959 --> 01:10:22.751
get married and have lots of kids.


01:10:23.126 --> 01:10:24.376
No way.


01:10:26.501 --> 01:10:28.334
You must not give in.


01:10:33.792 --> 01:10:35.167
I'm confident you can do it.
